# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository and checked out native.
# Without this, core.autocrlf is a per-machine setting: a clone on a Mac or a
# Linux CI runner would rewrite every line of every file it touches, and the
# resulting whole-file diffs would bury the real change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# SQL in supabase/ is pasted into the Supabase SQL editor by hand. LF only.
*.sql text eol=lf
